sional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gutan-complete:line058-pei01-01","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gutan-complete"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gutan-complete:line058-pei01-01:m0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"恂","kind":"person","person_id":"nk1_x97_dax","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gutan-complete:line058-pei01-01","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gutan-complete"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangxiu-complete:line036:m0123","start":123,"end":125,"surface":"陳恂","kind":"person","person_id":"nk1_x97_dax","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangxiu-complete:line036","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangxiu-complete"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-wu052-gt-12","person_id":"nk1_x97_dax","title":"典军","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gutan-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-gutan-complete","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gutan-complete:line058-pei01-01","quote":"吴录曰：全琮父子屡言芍陂之役为典军陈恂诈增张休、顾承之功，而休、承与恂通情。休坐系狱，权为谭故，沉吟不决，欲令谭谢而释之。及大会，以问谭，谭不谢，而曰：「陛下，谗言其兴乎！」","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gutan-complete:line058-pei01-01:m0017"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-wu052-gt-12:a","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gutan-complete:line058-pei01-01","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"典军","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gutan-complete:line058-pei01-01:m0017","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本來源官稱或所任，未受另記。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"th-wu052-zx-7","person_id":"nk1_x97_dax","title":"典軍","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangxiu-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-zhangxiu-complete","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangxiu-complete:line036","quote":"休字叔嗣，弱冠與諸葛恪、顧譚等俱爲太子登僚友，以《漢書》授登。從中庶子轉爲右弼都尉。權常遊獵，迨幕乃歸，休上疏諫戒，權大善之，以示於昭。及登卒後，爲侍中，拜羽林都督，平三典軍事，遷揚武將軍。爲魯王霸友黨所譖，與顧譚、承俱以芍陂論功事，休、承與典軍陳恂通情，詐增其伐，並徙交州。中書令孫弘佞偽險詖，休素所忿，弘因是譖訴，下詔書賜休死，時年四十一。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangxiu-complete:line036:m0123"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-wu052-zx-7:a","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangxiu-complete:line036","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"典軍","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangxiu-complete:line036:m0123","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本來源官稱或所任，未受另記。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-047-sun-quan:p084","text":"吳書曰：初，張彌、許晏等俱到襄平，官屬從者四百許人。淵欲圖彌、晏，先分其人眾，置遼東諸縣，以中使秦旦、張群、杜德、黃疆等及吏兵六十人，置玄菟郡。玄菟郡在遼東北，相去二百里，太守王贊領戸二百，兼重可三四百人。旦等皆舍於民家，仰其飲食。積四十許日，旦與疆等議曰：「吾人遠辱國命，自棄於此，與死亡何異？今觀此郡，形勢甚弱。若一旦同心，焚燒城郭，殺其長吏，爲國報恥，然後伏死，足以無恨。孰與偷生苟活長爲囚虜乎？」疆等然之。於是陰相約結，當用八月十九日夜發。其日中時，爲部中張松所告，贊便會士眾閉城門。旦、群、德、疆等皆逾城得走。時群病疽創著膝，不及輩旅，德常扶接與俱，崎嶇山谷。行六七百里，創益困，不復能前，臥草中，相守悲泣。群曰：「吾不幸創甚，死亡無日，卿諸人宜速進道，冀有所達。空相守，俱死於窮谷之中，何益也？」德曰：「萬里流離，死生共之，不忍相委。」於是推旦、疆使前，德獨留守群，捕菜果食之。旦、疆別數日，得達句驪（王宮），因宣詔於句驪王宮及其主簿，詔言有賜爲遼東所攻奪。宮等大喜，即受詔，命使人隨旦還迎群、德。其年，宮遣皁衣二十五人送旦等還，奉表稱臣，貢貂皮千枚，鶡雞皮十具。旦等見權，悲喜不能自勝。權義之，皆拜校尉。間一年，遣使者謝宏、中書陳恂拜宮爲單於，加賜衣物珍寶。恂等到安平口，先遣校尉陳奉前見宮，而宮受魏幽州刺史諷旨，令以吳使自效。奉聞之，倒還。宮遣主簿笮咨、帶固等出安平，與宏相見。宏即縛得三十餘人質之，宮於是謝罪，上馬數百匹。宏乃遣咨、固奉詔書賜物與宮。是時宏船小，載馬八十匹而還。","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":91,"last_line":91,"raw_start":17